  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "來去掠地牛（有聲♪）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pXE2VQgjFAs?list=PLXGFtP8Nq2rPRttUxu-6cAsoUJjZAB6BQ\" width=\"560\"></iframe></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br />\n台文通訊BONG報十月號（No.271）</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n-----------------------------------------------<br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">▍來去掠地牛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">作者：林美麗</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left; text-indent: 24pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">細漢</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">時，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hām</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">阿公去掠地牛是我上快樂</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">代誌！</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left; text-indent: 24pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">伊騎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">oo-tóo-bái</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">載我</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kap</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">小弟，阿兄就騎跤踏車</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tuè tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">後壁，就</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">án-ne</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">guán</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">一行四名，「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">phuh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">phuh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">phuh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">phuh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">」騎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tuì</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">舊飛行機場</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hia</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。機場拄好</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">屏南工業區</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">牆圍仔外，一片闊莽莽，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">khah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">倚工業區</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hit</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">頭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">草仔生</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kah őm-ōm</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，有人放牛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tī hia</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">食草。阿公</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tshuā guán tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">沙仔地</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tsit</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">頭揣，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tsia</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">四</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">khoo</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">輾轉無圍也無</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tsa̍h</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，佳哉日頭無</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kài mé</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，若無，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">guán</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">一定曝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">變人乾。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left; text-indent: 24pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">「地牛是啥？」我問阿公。阿公刁工</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">我</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hánn</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，講：「啊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">to</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">蹛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">塗跤底</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">牛啊，伊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">mā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">有兩支角，你若</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">弄，伊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ē kā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">你</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tak őo</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">！」哪有可能？我</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">信！伊若</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kài</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">大隻哪</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ē</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">蹛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">塗跤？而且</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">guán</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">雙手</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">gīm</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">兩片薑－</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ia̍h</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">無提</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ke-si</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，是</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">beh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">按怎「掠」？阿公教</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">guán</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">先揣有落陷</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">親像酒漏仔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">塗空，講地牛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ē bih tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">內底納涼。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left; text-indent: 24pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">阿兄目色好，真緊就揣著一空，阿公</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā guán hiàm</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">倚</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">來，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">koh suà</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">手</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">at</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">一枝草仔枝，沓沓仔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">伸入去塗空</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">lā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。無一下久，草仔枝有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">leh tín</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">動，阿公緊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā giú--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">出</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">來，一隻</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">phú-phú</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">細細隻仔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">龜仔，就</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hōo</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">草仔枝釣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">出</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">來</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--ah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。哪</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ē tsiah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">趣味？地牛可能</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kài iau-sâi ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">款，若無，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">guán ia̍h</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">無用啥</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">mi̍h</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">做釣餌，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">suah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">凊凊彩彩就</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">釣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">著</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--ah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left; text-indent: 24pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">阿公</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">地牛囥</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">手底</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hōo guán</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">觀察。詳細</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">看，伊除了有一對角</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">koh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">有六肢跤，連腹肚</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">mā</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">圓滾滾，身軀頂有發幼毛仔，生做是有夠奇怪。阿公講：「地牛真</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">gōng</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，若揣無草仔枝，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tshuah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">妹妹</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">頭毛來釣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">mā ē</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">使</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">得。」啥！</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">Beh tshuah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">我</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">頭毛去釣地牛？我</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tsiah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">無愛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">--leh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，到時若</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tshuah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">了了，我</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">就變秃頭？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left; text-indent: 24pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">大漢了後，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">tsiah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">知影阿公講</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">「地牛」就是專門食狗蟻</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">『蟻獅』，伊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ē bih tī</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">沙仔地</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">iah</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">是草埔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">塗跤底，而且伊是「沙牛」</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">是「地牛」，因為阿公</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">m̄-bat</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">字，可能</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">án-ne</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">來</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hut m̄-tio̍h--</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">去。伊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">koh</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">有真濟偏名，親像：「沙豬」、「沙猴」，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">管伊叫做啥</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">mi̍h</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">hit</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">段掠地牛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">日子，是</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">guán</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">做囡仔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">時上</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">suí ê</span><a href=\"https://www.blogger.com/null\" name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span style=\"font-family: , serif; font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">記持。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
  },
